menu "RoboHub MAX485 module"

config RH_BOARD_MAX485_MODULE
    bool "MAX485 RS485 transceiver carrier"
    select RH_HAL_RS485
    select RH_HAL_UART
    select RH_HAL_GPIO
    select RH_HAL_TIMER
    default n
    help
      A MAX485 RS485 transceiver carrier, bound to a UART and a direction pin.
      Selecting it makes the RoboHubRS485 interface available on a board that
      does not carry RS485 natively; the pins and speed are given when the
      module is brought up.

endmenu
